      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FERNAO (5) underrated stayer who gets every chance on the limit out to his right trip. Closed strongly with the 59kg for an unlucky second over 2200m at Doomben as fav. Can get the better of these at the good each way odds. THEBUDGIESMUGLA (1) exciting stayer yet to taste defeat over the 2400m in five starts. Was seven weeks between runs with a plugging fourth over 2000m in the G3 Premier's Cup at this track. Tightened up further now and the only niggle is the 59kg. SO YOU ARE (2) classy type who meets THEBUDGIESMUGLA better at the weights after his narrow defeat in the Caloundra Cup. Fitter now after finishing second over 2000m in the G3 Premier's Cup. Has options from the draw and due for a change of luck. SKY LAB (6) grand old gelding who can pull out a big performance today at the juicy odds. Ready for the trip and the senior rider hops aboard. AMPLIFY (7) can get the trip on the limit weight and her best form is on firmer tracks. Don't dismiss.",
